# Screenshot baselines are NOT committed.
#
# This repository exists to be cloned and re-pointed at another industry. The
# first thing a clone does is change the preset, which changes every label and
# every number on every screen -- so any baseline shipped here is stale on
# arrival and the new owner has to delete it before they can do anything.
#
# Pixel comparison is therefore opt-in (`npm run test:pixel`), and Playwright
# writes the baselines on first run. The functional browser tests, which are
# the ones that have actually caught bugs here, need no baselines and run by
# default.
tests/visual/__baselines__/
